## 🎯 Real-World Usage Example

### Use Case: Blog Publishing Platform

**Flow**:
1. Author writes draft post
2. Editor reviews and requests changes (PUT)
3. Author updates draft (PUT)
4. Editor approves → status changes to "published"
5. Readers discover post through list endpoint
6. Each view increments viewCount
7. Readers like posts
8. Author archives old posts (status = "archived")

**Implementation**:
```javascript
// Author creates draft
POST /api/blogs
{
  "title": "New article",
  "status": "draft",
  "isDraft": true,
  "author": "Kim Joyce"
}

// Editor reviews
GET /api/blogs?status=draft

// Editor publishes
PUT /api/blogs/1
{
  "status": "published",
  "isDraft": false,
  "publishedAt": 1710345600000
}

// Readers discover
GET /api/blogs?status=published

// Engagement tracked
POST /api/blogs/1/view
POST /api/blogs/1/like
```

