## 📈 Performance Characteristics

```
Operation         | Development | Production (PostgreSQL) | Notes
─────────────────┼─────────────┼────────────────────────┼─────────────
Create Post       | < 10ms      | < 50ms                 | JSON write
Read Post (cache) | < 1ms       | < 5ms                  | Memory
List (100 items)  | < 20ms      | < 100ms                | With indices
Search/Filter     | < 30ms      | < 150ms                | Category index
Update Post       | < 10ms      | < 50ms                 | Atomic write
Delete Post       | < 5ms       | < 30ms                 | Soft delete
Pagination        | O(1)        | O(1)                   | LIMIT/OFFSET
Concurrent Ops    | Serialized  | ACID Transactions      | With locking
```

